<!-- ✅ 정철대학 강의 계획표 — 퍼널모아 임베드용 (전역 스타일 오염 없음) -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Special+Elite&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════
   모든 선택자는 #jcu-roadmap 안에만 적용
   → 페이지 다른 섹션에 절대 영향 없음
══════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#jcu-roadmap,
#jcu-roadmap *,
#jcu-roadmap *::before,
#jcu-roadmap *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
#jcu-roadmap {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  background: #1a2e22;
  color: #F5F0E8;
  font-family: 'Pretendard','Noto Sans KR',sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  line-height: normal;
}
#jcu-roadmap ::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px;height:6px;}
#jcu-roadmap ::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#1a2e22;}
#jcu-roadmap ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#3d6652;border-radius:3px;}

@keyframes jcu-fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
@keyframes jcu-slideLeft{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0);}}
@keyframes jcu-blink{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:.15;}}
@keyframes jcu-uline{from{width:0;}to{width:100%;}}
@keyframes jcu-pulse-u{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(245,240,232,.35),0 0 10px rgba(245,240,232,.08);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 2.5px rgba(245,240,232,.8),0 0 28px rgba(245,240,232,.45),0 0 55px rgba(245,240,232,.15);}}
@keyframes jcu-pulse-l{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(240,192,128,.35),0 0 10px rgba(240,192,128,.08);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 2.5px rgba(240,192,128,.8),0 0 28px rgba(240,192,128,.45),0 0 55px rgba(240,192,128,.15);}}
@keyframes jcu-pulse-f{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 2.5px #FFE500,0 0 14px rgba(255,229,0,.25);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #FFE500,0 0 36px rgba(255,229,0,.7),0 0 70px rgba(255,229,0,.25);}}
@keyframes jcu-date-glow{0%,100%{color:#FFE500;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,229,0,.4);}50%{color:#fff9b0;text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,229,0,.95),0 0 36px rgba(255,229,0,.4);}}
@keyframes jcu-date-u{0%,100%{background:rgba(245,240,232,.08);color:rgba(245,240,232,.6);border-color:rgba(245,240,232,.2);}50%{background:rgba(245,240,232,.18);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(245,240,232,.8);text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(245,240,232,.5);}}
@keyframes jcu-date-l{0%,100%{background:rgba(240,192,128,.08);color:rgba(240,192,128,.6);border-color:rgba(240,192,128,.2);}50%{background:rgba(240,192,128,.18);color:#FFE8C0;border-color:rgba(240,192,128,.8);text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(240,192,128,.5);}}
@keyframes jcu-shine{0%{transform:translateX(-100%) skewX(-15deg);}100%{transform:translateX(220%) skewX(-15deg);}}
@keyframes jcu-float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-8px);}}
@keyframes jcu-badge-pop{0%{transform:scale(.9);opacity:0;}60%{transform:scale(1.06);}100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}}

/* 헤더 */
#jcu-roadmap .hd{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#0f1f16 0%,#1a2e22 40%,#243c32 70%,#1e3628 100%);padding:130px 60px 120px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:28px;border-bottom:4px solid #3d6652;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;border:20px solid #3c2812;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #5c3d1e;pointer-events:none;z-index:2;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;z-index:0;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-bg span{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,229,0,.18) 0%,transparent 70%);animation:jcu-float var(--dur,4s) ease-in-out infinite;animation-delay:var(--dl,0s);}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-bg span:nth-child(1){width:340px;height:340px;top:-80px;left:-60px;--dur:5s;--dl:0s;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-bg span:nth-child(2){width:260px;height:260px;top:40%;right:-40px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(240,192,128,.14) 0%,transparent 70%);--dur:6s;--dl:-2s;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-bg span:nth-child(3){width:180px;height:180px;bottom:-30px;left:30%;--dur:4.5s;--dl:-1s;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-inner{position:relative;z-index:3;width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:24px;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-dash{width:70%;height:2px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(245,240,232,.4) 0,rgba(245,240,232,.4) 10px,transparent 10px,transparent 18px);}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-eyebrow{font-family:'Special Elite',serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:8px;color:rgba(255,229,0,.8);text-transform:uppercase;animation:jcu-fadeUp .6s ease .1s both;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-title{font-size:76px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.15;color:#F5F0E8;letter-spacing:-2.5px;text-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);animation:jcu-fadeUp .7s ease .2s both;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-title-wrap{position:relative;display:inline-block;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-title-wrap::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-8px;left:0;height:5px;width:0;border-radius:3px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#FFE500 0,#FFE500 12px,transparent 12px,transparent 18px);animation:jcu-uline 1.4s ease 1s forwards;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-sub{font-size:22px;color:rgba(245,240,232,.6);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;animation:jcu-fadeUp .6s ease .3s both;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-stats{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;animation:jcu-fadeUp .6s ease .45s both;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-stat{padding:28px 52px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:default;transition:transform .25s;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-stat:hover{transform:scale(1.05) translateY(-4px);}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-stat::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;border:2px solid;border-radius:8px;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-stat::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-60%;width:40%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.08),transparent);transform:skewX(-15deg);animation:jcu-shine 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .st-u{background:rgba(245,240,232,.07);}
#jcu-roadmap .st-u::before{border-color:rgba(245,240,232,.45);}
#jcu-roadmap .st-l{background:rgba(240,192,128,.07);}
#jcu-roadmap .st-l::before{border-color:rgba(240,192,128,.45);}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-n{font-size:58px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-2px;}
#jcu-roadmap .st-u .hd-n{color:#F5F0E8;}
#jcu-roadmap .st-l .hd-n{color:#F0C080;}
#jcu-roadmap .hd-t{font-size:15px;color:rgba(245,240,232,.5);font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:.5px;}

/* 범례 */
#jcu-roadmap .legend{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:18px 32px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2a4438,#243c32);border-bottom:2px solid #3d6652;}
#jcu-roadmap .leg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:5px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;border:1.5px solid;transition:transform .2s,filter .2s;cursor:default;}
#jcu-roadmap .leg:hover{transform:scale(1.04);filter:brightness(1.1);}
#jcu-roadmap .leg-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0;}

/* 네비 */
#jcu-roadmap .mnav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:999;background:rgba(18,36,26,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:3px solid #3d6652;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-hint{text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:rgba(255,229,0,.65);padding:7px 0 4px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,229,0,.2);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:stretch;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;padding:0 16px;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-inner::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-yr{display:flex;align-items:center;font-family:'Special Elite',serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;padding:0 14px 0 4px;flex-shrink:0;border-right:1px dashed rgba(245,240,232,.18);margin-right:4px;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-yr.y26{color:rgba(255,229,0,.85);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-yr.y27{color:rgba(240,192,128,.85);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-div{width:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin:8px 4px;flex-shrink:0;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px 18px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Pretendard',sans-serif;color:rgba(245,240,232,.28);white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;position:relative;transition:color .18s,background .18s;gap:2px;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:50%;right:50%;height:3px;transition:left .2s,right .2s;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn:hover{color:rgba(245,240,232,.85);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn:hover::after{left:8%;right:8%;background:rgba(255,229,0,.5);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn.on26{color:#F5F0E8;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn.on26::after{left:5%;right:5%;background:#FFE500;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,229,0,.7);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn.on27{color:#F0C080;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-btn.on27::after{left:5%;right:5%;background:#F0C080;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(240,192,128,.7);}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-num{font-size:28px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;}
#jcu-roadmap .nav-ko{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;opacity:.55;}

/* 연도 배너 */
#jcu-roadmap .yr-ban{padding:48px 44px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-num{font-size:90px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-4px;}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-num.y26{color:#FFE500;text-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35),0 0 60px rgba(255,229,0,.2);}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-num.y27{color:#F0C080;text-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35),0 0 60px rgba(240,192,128,.2);}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-num.y28{color:rgba(245,240,232,.3);}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-sub{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;opacity:.45;text-transform:uppercase;}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-desc{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;opacity:.6;}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-line{flex:1;height:2px;}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-line.y26{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,229,0,.5),rgba(255,229,0,.05));}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-line.y27{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(240,192,128,.5),rgba(240,192,128,.05));}
#jcu-roadmap .yr-line.y28{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(200,200,200,.2),transparent);}

/* 월 섹션 */
#jcu-roadmap .month-sec{padding:0 44px 52px;}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px;padding:10px 10px 10px 22px;position:relative;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:6px;border-radius:3px;}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head.y26::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFE500,rgba(255,229,0,.4));box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(255,229,0,.6);}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head.y27::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#F0C080,rgba(240,192,128,.4));box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(240,192,128,.6);}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head.y26{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,229,0,.06),transparent);}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head.y27{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(240,192,128,.06),transparent);}
#jcu-roadmap .month-num{font-size:72px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-3px;text-shadow:2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3);}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head.y26 .month-num{color:#F5F0E8;}
#jcu-roadmap .month-head.y27 .month-num{color:#F0C080;}
#jcu-roadmap .month-ko{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(245,240,232,.4);}
#jcu-roadmap .month-count{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 14px;margin-left:auto;align-self:center;color:rgba(245,240,232,.5);}

/* 과정 라벨 */
#jcu-roadmap .clbl{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:14px;padding:6px 14px 6px 0;position:relative;}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;border-radius:1px;}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl.u{color:#F5F0E8;}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl.u::after{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(245,240,232,.35),transparent);}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl.l{color:#F0C080;}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl.l::after{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(240,192,128,.35),transparent);}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0;}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl.u .clbl-dot{background:#FFE500;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,229,0,.8);}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl.l .clbl-dot{background:#F0C080;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(240,192,128,.8);}
#jcu-roadmap .clbl-count{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:10px;padding:2px 10px;color:rgba(245,240,232,.5);}

/* 카드 그리드 */
#jcu-roadmap .card-grid{display:grid;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
@media(min-width:900px){#jcu-roadmap .card-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
@media(min-width:1200px){#jcu-roadmap .card-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}

/* 카드 */
#jcu-roadmap .card{border-radius:8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:220px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .28s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1),filter .25s;cursor:default;border:2px solid;}
#jcu-roadmap .card.lnk{cursor:pointer;}
#jcu-roadmap .card::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0,transparent 47px,rgba(255,255,255,.012) 47px,rgba(255,255,255,.012) 48px);}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-on{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1c3028 0%,#263c30 50%,#2c4438 100%);border-color:rgba(245,240,232,.6);animation:jcu-pulse-u 3s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-off{background:rgba(245,240,232,.05);border-color:rgba(245,240,232,.35);border-style:dashed;animation:jcu-pulse-u 2s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-on{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1a2c24 0%,#243428 50%,#2a3c30 100%);border-color:rgba(240,192,128,.55);animation:jcu-pulse-l 3s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-off{background:rgba(240,192,128,.05);border-color:rgba(240,192,128,.35);border-style:dashed;animation:jcu-pulse-l 2s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-fin{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#2a2800 0%,#3a3600 50%,#464200 100%);border-color:#FFE500;border-width:2.5px;animation:jcu-pulse-f 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-on:hover,#jcu-roadmap .cu-off:hover,#jcu-roadmap .cl-on:hover,#jcu-roadmap .cl-off:hover,#jcu-roadmap .c-fin:hover{transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-6px) rotate(.5deg);filter:brightness(1.18);animation-play-state:paused;z-index:10;position:relative;}

/* 날짜 배지 */
#jcu-roadmap .c-date{display:block;width:100%;padding:13px 20px;font-size:17px;font-weight:900;position:relative;z-index:1;border-bottom:2px solid;letter-spacing:.3px;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-date.don{font-size:19px;animation:jcu-date-glow 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;background:rgba(255,229,0,.09);color:#FFE500;border-color:rgba(255,229,0,.3);}
#jcu-roadmap .c-date.doff{font-size:16px;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-off .c-date.doff{animation:jcu-date-u 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-off .c-date.doff{animation:jcu-date-l 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;}

/* 카드 본문 */
#jcu-roadmap .c-body{padding:18px 20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-title{font-size:27px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.3;position:relative;z-index:1;display:inline;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-on .c-title{color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(transparent 52%,rgba(245,240,232,.2) 52%);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding-bottom:2px;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-off .c-title{color:rgba(245,240,232,.6);}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-on .c-title{color:#FFE8C0;background:linear-gradient(transparent 52%,rgba(240,192,128,.2) 52%);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding-bottom:2px;}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-off .c-title{color:rgba(240,192,128,.6);}
#jcu-roadmap .c-fin .c-title{color:#FFE500;background:linear-gradient(transparent 48%,rgba(255,229,0,.28) 48%);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5),0 0 24px rgba(255,229,0,.45);padding-bottom:2px;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-arr{font-size:13px;opacity:.5;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-sub{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7;flex:1;position:relative;z-index:1;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-on .c-sub{color:rgba(245,240,232,.75);}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-off .c-sub{color:rgba(245,240,232,.42);}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-on .c-sub{color:rgba(240,192,128,.75);}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-off .c-sub{color:rgba(240,192,128,.42);}
#jcu-roadmap .c-fin .c-sub{color:rgba(255,229,0,.65);}
#jcu-roadmap .c-status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 18px;border-radius:5px;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;align-self:flex-start;position:relative;z-index:1;overflow:hidden;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-status::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-40%;width:30%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.15),transparent);transform:skewX(-15deg);animation:jcu-shine 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-on .c-status{background:#F5F0E8;color:#1a2e22;}
#jcu-roadmap .cl-on .c-status{background:#F0C080;color:#1e2820;}
#jcu-roadmap .c-fin .c-status{background:#FFE500;color:#1a1a00;animation:jcu-badge-pop .4s ease both;}
#jcu-roadmap .cu-off .c-status,#jcu-roadmap .cl-off .c-status{display:none;}

/* 구분선 */
#jcu-roadmap .divider{height:2px;margin:0 44px 44px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(245,240,232,.12) 0,rgba(245,240,232,.12) 8px,transparent 8px,transparent 16px);}

/* 2028 섹션 */
#jcu-roadmap .cs-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:64px 40px 80px;text-align:center;gap:26px;}
#jcu-roadmap .cs-title{font-size:52px;font-weight:900;color:#F5F0E8;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1.2;text-shadow:2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3);}
#jcu-roadmap .cs-sub{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(245,240,232,.65);line-height:1.85;max-width:560px;}
#jcu-roadmap .cs-badge{font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#F5F0E8;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:2px dashed rgba(245,240,232,.3);border-radius:8px;padding:16px 36px;letter-spacing:1px;}

/* 푸터 */
#jcu-roadmap .foot{text-align:center;padding:28px 20px;font-family:'Special Elite',serif;font-size:16px;color:rgba(245,240,232,.28);background:#0f1f16;border-top:2px solid #3d6652;}

/* 애니메이션 클래스 */
#jcu-roadmap .fu{opacity:0;animation:jcu-fadeUp .22s ease forwards;}
#jcu-roadmap .fl{opacity:0;animation:jcu-slideLeft .22s ease forwards;}

/* 모바일 */
@media(max-width:767px){
  #jcu-roadmap .hd{padding:90px 20px 80px;}
